 "text": "Welcome to Hillsdale County, Michigan\nHOME\nCalendar\nPublic Notices\nFOIA Requests\nGovernment\nBoard of Commissioners\nBuilding Inspection\nCounty Clerk\nDrain Commission\nEqualization\nFetch GIS Online Maps\nFinance\nPlanning Commission\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nTreasurer's Office\nVeterans Affairs\nCourts & Law\n1st Judicial Circuit Court (Criminal, Divorces)\n2B District Court (Small Claims, Tickets)\nDrug Court (All Courts)\nFriend of the Court (Child Support)\nJuvenile Services (Truancy, Juvenile Drug Court)\nProbate/Family Court (Probate, Adoptions)\nProsecuting Attorney\nSheriff's Office\nHealth & Safety\nCentral Dispatch 911\n911 Statistical Reports\nEmergency Management\nHealth Department\nMedical Care Facility\nMedical Control Board\nMedical Examiner\nMaterials Management Planning\nSubstance Use Recovery Resources\nWellWise Area Agency on Aging\nElection Info\nSEARCH...\n29 N Howell Street 517-437-7758\nSpecial Notices\nCounty Office Building Elevator Out of Order.\nThe elevator at the County Office Building (COB) is not working and repairs are underway. However, the electronics may take months to repair. Until that time, if you have accessibility issues and need service from the Equalization Office, Register of Deeds, or County Treasurer's Office, please call ahead and staff will meet with you on the first floor. We have also placed a phone at the elevator entrance for you to call upstairs to request assistance. We apologize for this inconvenience. Further, we have a WebEx session setup for county meetings in the conference room if you would like to attend electronically, including making public comment. Please go to meeting link https://hillsdalecounty.webex.com/hillsdalecounty/j.php?MTID=md1be447ca7b1a50b16f356e070c35bbf to join. You may also call in using phone number 404-397-1516 and use meeting number 2349 319 6114 with password 4473295.\nIn the Community\nCommunity Action Agency\nCounty Fair\nCounty Parks\nDog Licenses (Dec 1